<title>GERMANY: Bonn announces schedule for Feb 8 G7 meeting.</title>
<headline>Bonn announces schedule for Feb 8 G7 meeting.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-02-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German Finance Ministry released the following programme for the meeting of Group of Seven finance ministers and central bank heads scheduled for February 8 in Berlin (all times GMT):</p>
<p>1045  Welcome by German Finance Minister Theo Waigel</p>
<p>	    at the Kronprinzenpalais</p>
<p>1300  Group photo</p>
<p>1315  Start of working session</p>
<p>1615  News conferences by delegations</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
